  unitName: War Captain Mega
  unitId: 20123
  unitNumber: 157
  description: A pirate captain from the seas near the ruined Sama Kingdom. Mega
    masterfully commanded his pirate crew until one day the Sama Kingdom Navy appeared.
    They requested he join them as their new admiral and help reorganize their forces.
    He had always hated the corrupt navy, but agreed to their terms and did his best
    to improve their reputation.
  summonDesc: Champion of the seas?<br>That's an understatement.<br>My axe is invincible!
  fusionDesc: Argh, aha!<br>I have an entire Navy at <br>my command!
  evoDesc: Can you feel the waves, too?<br>It would be a waste not to <br>ride them!
  element: 2
  rarity: 3
